        },
        {
          "text": "Umwi wabasiŋanda bamwami, uutegwa Habona, wakati, Kuŋanda ya-Hamani, nkocili caanzikilo, bulamfu bwaco madumpwa aali kumi, ncaakabambila Moodekai wakagwasya mwami. Mwami wakati, Amumwaanzikile alincico, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
